==Trivia==
*She is tied with [[Nutcracker Witch (Enemy)|Nutcracker Witch]] for the second-most abilities out of all enemies, with [[Unit-13's False Evolution]] and [[Bears Be Back]] both being in the first place.
*Walpurgisnacht is also the name of a German holiday. Walpurgis is a celebration commemorating Saint Walpurga starting on April 30th and ending on the 1st of May, while 'Nacht' means 'night' in German. Walpurgis is commonly associated with religion and celebrations and, like many things associated with religions, also with witchcraft.
*She is the first and currently the only enemy to have a [[Critical Hit|Critical]] chance of 100%.
*She is the only enemy from the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]] whose name was not changed in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]].

